    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse and Unique Units</h2>The game features a total of 10 races: Dungeon, Infernals, Imperials, Barbarian, Mechanicals, Elves, Celestials, Tower, Undead, Orcs. There are over 100 distinct units (with 62 available at launch), each with unique skills. New units will be continuously added in future updates or DLC.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/e53334e2fd397e777b90f5829190c429.avif?t=1749469189\" width=616 height=331 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource management &amp; Army Cultivation</h2>Various random loot box mechanics for players to develop their ideal, distinctive army.<br>In the Training Grounds, you can collect fragments of units you\u2019ve unlocked to upgrade them.<br>The game does not include in-game purchases, with all resources being reasonably configured and accessible through various methods.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/afc512be82197764f816b45dcea592a6.avif?t=1749469189\" width=616 height=331 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/4dcc23527e5c1f6d754deb527d41bfd5.avif?t=1749469189\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/e2e0fb717eded99dbdef9520618f563d.avif?t=1749469189\" width=616 height=331 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategically Designed Combat</h2>Choose your preferred or most suitable units to deploy. Combat is entirely skill-based, with no random elements \u2013 victory depends solely on your tactical unit configuration.<br>Choose the right formation and strategy to counter your opponent\u2019s units effectively.<br>Utilize the reinforcement system to turn the tide of battle or dominate your foes.<br>Combine the abilities of your units to enjoy creative synergies and unexpected fun through combat.<br>You can also explore mysterious caves, defeat powerful enemies, and claim unrivaled wealth and glory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/1c4b9ded062e9f65e0933b13f01cd44d.avif?t=1749469189\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/764c620d5d879986dfd1eb86969d6a96.avif?t=1749469189\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvP Challenges</h2>You can upload your defensive formation to the Ladder system for other players to challenge or match up against real player formations.<br>Break through the formation of other players and prove to be the ultimate spear or the toughest shield.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/076f746264797a008b3548363eb4a28f.avif?t=1749469189\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diverse and Unique Units</h2>The game features a total of 10 races: Dungeon, Infernals, Imperials, Barbarian, Mechanicals, Elves, Celestials, Tower, Undead, Orcs. There are over 100 distinct units (with 62 available at launch), each with unique skills. New units will be continuously added in future updates or DLC.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/e53334e2fd397e777b90f5829190c429.avif?t=1749469189\" width=616 height=331 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource management &amp; Army Cultivation</h2>Various random loot box mechanics for players to develop their ideal, distinctive army.<br>In the Training Grounds, you can collect fragments of units you\u2019ve unlocked to upgrade them.<br>The game does not include in-game purchases, with all resources being reasonably configured and accessible through various methods.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/afc512be82197764f816b45dcea592a6.avif?t=1749469189\" width=616 height=331 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/4dcc23527e5c1f6d754deb527d41bfd5.avif?t=1749469189\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/e2e0fb717eded99dbdef9520618f563d.avif?t=1749469189\" width=616 height=331 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategically Designed Combat</h2>Choose your preferred or most suitable units to deploy. Combat is entirely skill-based, with no random elements \u2013 victory depends solely on your tactical unit configuration.<br>Choose the right formation and strategy to counter your opponent\u2019s units effectively.<br>Utilize the reinforcement system to turn the tide of battle or dominate your foes.<br>Combine the abilities of your units to enjoy creative synergies and unexpected fun through combat.<br>You can also explore mysterious caves, defeat powerful enemies, and claim unrivaled wealth and glory.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/1c4b9ded062e9f65e0933b13f01cd44d.avif?t=1749469189\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/764c620d5d879986dfd1eb86969d6a96.avif?t=1749469189\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvP Challenges</h2>You can upload your defensive formation to the Ladder system for other players to challenge or match up against real player formations.<br>Break through the formation of other players and prove to be the ultimate spear or the toughest shield.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2782580/extras/076f746264797a008b3548363eb4a28f.avif?t=1749469189\" data-has-big width=800 height=430 /></span>",
